<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Kawasho Gecoss cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kawasho Gecoss cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaichi Research Institute</p>
<p>of Securities and Economics Inc said it downgraded Kawasho</p>
<p>Gecoss Corporation to a &quot;2&quot; rating from its previous &quot;1&quot;.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns</p>
<p>a &quot;2&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees moving within 10</p>
<p>percentage points in either direction of the Tokyo Stock Exchange</p>
<p>first-section TOPIX index over the next six months.</p>
</text>
